@voice moleth
// Writer (command: guests). Moleth (they/them), Veyli scholar (the diplomatic visit). Cabin 4-02. Studies human ships and
// asks questions nobody has asked before. Wants to see the engine room more than anything. Forty questions for Calder.
// HOW THEY TALK: eager, formal, all questions; "May I ask..." then four more questions. Delighted by ordinary things.
// NEVER: stops asking; is rude about a human thing (only curious).
tpl: earnest
